%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4b3f2a8c8f344355b16a4d4296ae3f98, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dolphin
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  vesselClass: 2
  entries:
  - Element: 1
    AbilityLabel: Echo Sight
    AbilityDescription: 'Hold the right trigger and every prism standing inside the next
      crystal blast''s destruction volume lights up. Charge sets how THICK that blast is
      - the capsule''s diameter across the beam, authored on
      VesselExplosionByCrystalEffectSO as 0.75x the authored core at the resting level
      rising to 1.5x at level 10. It is the one element whose slot both AIMS the weapon
      and SHAPES it, which is why the sight and the thickness share it: the profile you
      are widening is the profile the sight draws. Note the total extent across the gape
      is set by banked energy, so Charge does not make the blast bigger - it redistributes
      that extent, trading a long thin beam for a fat round one. At level 5 the sight
      also lights up VESSELS caught in the same volume, each in its own domain''s colour.'
    Input: 1
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Pilot Echo
    UpgradeDescription: The sight shows pilots too - any vessel inside the blast lights
      up in its own domain colour.
  - Element: 2
    AbilityLabel: Crystal Seeding
    AbilityDescription: PASSIVE - no input. Every recharge the Dolphin seeds one
      crystal AHEAD of its nose, about 220 u down its line, so the seed is ammunition
      you fly straight into - seed, line up, blast. The recharge is 15 s at rest and
      half that at level 10. Below level 5 the seed is an ordinary OMNI crystal that
      any pilot who reaches it first may take; at level 5 it lands TEAM-locked and
      only your domain can collect it.
    Input: 0
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Claimed Seed
    UpgradeDescription: Seeded crystals land team-locked - only your domain can collect
      them.
  - Element: 3
    AbilityLabel: Echo Obliteration
    AbilityDescription: Fly into a crystal and the Dolphin's jaw throws a cone of
      destruction down its nose. Space carries the cone further, x2 at level 10.
      Three elements shape one blast - banked skim energy sets its GAPE (the jaw on
      the card), Charge its THICKNESS, Space its REACH - and the seeds the Dolphin
      plants ahead of itself keep it fed. At level 5 the blast spares your own domain.
    Input: 0
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Clean Blast
    UpgradeDescription: The cone spares your own domain - no more friendly fire.
  - Element: 4
    AbilityLabel: Drift Charge
    AbilityDescription: 'Drift to bank boost, let go to spend it - the drift IS the
      charge, and the lower card fills with it. Time sets how fast the bank fills,
      x1 at rest and x2.5 at level 10, so a high-Time Dolphin banks a full boost in
      one short drift. Time does not touch the boost''s speed. At level 5 the drift
      itself becomes the ward - while drifting a danger prism''s all-element drain
      does not land.'
    Input: 2
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Drift Ward
    UpgradeDescription: 'While drifting you take no elemental debuff - a danger prism''s
      all-element drain does not land. Everything else still does: the full-strength slow
      (x3 magnitude, x3 duration) and the halving of your banked blast energy. Your banked
      boost is halved too, but the drift you are already in refills it.'
  omniAbilityLabel: triggers its blast
